                        <div class="stat-value kda">2.35</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Average KDA</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="matchup-difficulty">
                    <div class="difficulty-label">Matchup Difficulty: MEDIUM</div>
                    <div class="difficulty-text">Zed has a slight advantage in this matchup with proper execution</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="card-title">Laning Phase Tips</h2>
                <ul class="tip-list">
                    <li><strong>Level 1-3:</strong> Focus on farming with Q (Razor Shuriken). Avoid extended trades as Orianna has stronger early poke.</li>
                    <li><strong>Level 3 Power Spike:</strong> Once you have all 3 basic abilities, look for short trades using W (Living Shadow) + E (Shadow Slash) + Q combos.</li>
                    <li><strong>Ball Position:</strong> Always track Orianna's ball position. When the ball is away from her, she's vulnerable to all-ins.</li>
                    <li><strong>Dodge Command: Shockwave:</strong> Save your W or R to dodge Orianna's ultimate. Bait it out before committing to a full combo.</li>
                    <li><strong>Wave Management:</strong> Freeze near your tower to force Orianna to overextend, creating gank opportunities.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="card-title">Rune Recommendations</h2>
                <div class="phase-title">Primary (Domination):</div>
                <div class="rune-item">Electrocute - For burst damage</div>
                <div class="rune-item">Sudden Impact - Synergy with shadow dashes</div>
                <div class="rune-item">Eyeball Collection - Snowball potential</div>
                <div class="rune-item">Ultimate Hunter - Reduced Death Mark cooldown</div>

                <div class="phase-title">Secondary (Precision):</div>
                <div class="rune-item">Triumph - Sustain in teamfights</div>
                <div class="rune-item">Coup de Grace - Execute low health targets</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="card-title">Item Build Priority</h2>
                <div class="phase-title">Core Items:</div>
                <div class="item-item">Youmuu's Ghostblade - First item for lethality and mobility</div>
                <div class="item-item">Duskblade of Draktharr - Second item for additional burst</div>
                <div class="item-item">Serylda's Grudge - Third item for armor penetration</div>

                <div class="phase-title">Situational Items:</div>
                <div class="item-item">Edge of Night - Against skillshot-heavy teams</div>
                <div class="item-item">Maw of Malmortius - Against AP burst</div>
                <div class="item-item">Guardian Angel - For teamfight survivability</div>

                <div class="phase-title">Boots:</div>
                <div class="item-item">Ionian Boots of Lucidity - For ability haste</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="card-title">Combo Execution</h2>
                <ul class="tip-list">
                    <li><strong>Basic Trade:</strong> W (place shadow) → E (slow) → Q (shurikens) → W2 (swap back)</li>
                    <li><strong>All-in Combo:</strong> R (Death Mark) → W (behind target) → E → Q → Auto attacks → R2 (back to safety)</li>
                    <li><strong>Advanced:</strong> Use W before R to have an escape shadow ready after your ultimate</li>
                    <li><strong>Key Timing:</strong> Wait for Orianna's E (Command: Protect) to be on cooldown before engaging</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2 class="card-title">Teamfight Strategy</h2>
                <ul class="tip-list">
                    <li><strong>Target Selection:</strong> Prioritize squishy carries. Avoid diving if Orianna has her ultimate ready.</li>
                    <li><strong>Flanking:</strong> Use your mobility to flank from unexpected angles.</li>
                    <li><strong>Zhonya's Counter:</strong> Bait out Zhonya's Hourglass before committing your full combo.</li>
                    <li><strong>Split Push:</strong> Zed excels at split pushing. Create pressure on side lanes to force Orianna to respond.</li>
                    <li><strong>Vision Control:</strong> Use Oracle Lens to clear wards for better flank opportunities.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <div class="patch-info">Based on current patch data (April 2026)</div>
            <p>This guide is for educational purposes. Matchup statistics and strategies may vary based on skill level and game state.</p>
            <p>Always adapt your playstyle to the specific game situation and team compositions.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
