Here’s the code for the `LoanCalculator` procedure in VeloxTS:

```typescript
import { Procedure } from '@veloxjs/core';

interface LoanInput {
  principal: number;
  annualRate: number;
  years: number;
}

interface LoanOutput {
  monthlyPayment: number;
  totalInterest: number;
  totalRepayment: number;
}

export default new Procedure<LoanInput, LoanOutput>({
  name: 'LoanCalculator',
  async execute({ principal, annualRate, years }) {
    const monthlyRate = annualRate / 12 / 100;
    const totalPayments = years * 12;
    const numerator = monthlyRate * Math.pow(1 + monthlyRate, totalPayments);
    const denominator = Math.pow(1 + monthlyRate, totalPayments) - 1;
    const monthlyPayment = principal * (numerator / denominator);
    const totalRepayment = monthlyPayment * totalPayments;
    const totalInterest = totalRepayment - principal;

    return {
      monthlyPayment: parseFloat(monthlyPayment.toFixed(2)),
      totalInterest: parseFloat(totalInterest.toFixed(2)),
      totalRepayment: parseFloat(totalRepayment.toFixed(2)),
    };
  },
});
```

### How to Use:
1. **Install VeloxTS**: If you haven't already, set up a VeloxTS project using `npx create-velox-app my-app`.
