    "install": "Install the component using your preferred package manager: pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add \"https://magicui.design/r/blur-fade.json\" or npm/npx: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://magicui.design/r/blur-fade.json\" or yarn: yarn dlx shadcn@latest add \"https://magicui.design/r/blur-fade.json\" or bun: bunx shadcn@latest add \"https://magicui.design/r/blur-fade.json\". After installation, you can import the component like this: import { BlurFade } from \"@/components/ui/blur-fade\";",
