tivationfor agents to learn and explore, and encouraging the development of general and flexible problem-solving strategies [42 – 44]. Our automatic curriculum capitalizes on the internet-scale knowledgecontained within GPT-4 by prompting it to provide a steady stream of new tasks or challenges. Thecurriculum unfolds in a bottom-up fashion, allowing for considerable adaptability and responsivenessto the exploration progress and the agent’s current state (Fig. 3). As VOYAGER progresses to harderself-driven goals, it naturally learns a variety of skills, such as “mining a diamond”.3"
