                <h3 class="paper-title">How Fast Can I Run My VLA? Demystifying VLA Inference Performance with VLA-Perf</h3>
                <div class="paper-authors">Wenqi Jiang, Jason Clemons, Karu Sankaralingam, Christos Kozyrakis</div>
                <p class="paper-abstract">Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models have recently demonstrated impressive capabilities across various embodied AI tasks. While deploying VLA models on real-world robots imposes strict real-time inference constraints, the inference performance landscape of VLA remains poorly understood due to the large combinatorial space...</p>
                <div class="paper-meta">
