                <p class="paper-abstract">Embodied AI systems face unique security challenges that combine vulnerabilities from large language models, cyber-physical systems, and their integration. This paper investigates the security landscape of embodied AI, identifying critical attack vectors and proposing defense mechanisms for safe deployment in real-world applications.</p>
                <div class="paper-meta">
