                <p class="paper-abstract">Moving beyond the traditional paradigm of adapting internet-pretrained models to physical tasks, we present DM0, an Embodied-Native Vision-Language-Action (VLA) framework designed for Physical AI. DM0 is trained from scratch on embodied data and demonstrates superior performance on real-world robotic tasks compared to adapted foundation models.</p>
                <div class="paper-meta">
                    <div class="paper-date">Submitted: February 16, 2026</div>
                    <div class="paper-links">
