{"diagram": "graph TD
    S[Suppliers] --> D1{Stock Level Check}
    D1 -->|Low Stock| W[Warehouse]
    D1 -->|Adequate Stock| S

    W --> D2{Quality Check}
    D2 -->|Pass| ST[Storage]
    D2 -->|Fail| R[Return to Supplier]

    ST --> POS[Point of Sale]
    POS --> A[Analytics Dashboard]

    A --> D3{Reorder Decision}
    D3 -->|Yes| S
    D3 -->|No| A", "format": "png"}

