## 5. Backend Configuration (Telerik Reporting REST Service)

Ensure your backend (ASP.NET Core or .NET Framework) runs the Telerik Reporting REST service:

- **.NET Core**: Install `Telerik.Reporting.Services.AspNetCore` package.
- **.NET Framework**: Install `Telerik.Reporting.Services.WebApi` package.

