1. **Set up your feature flag system** (LaunchDarkly, Flagsmith, or custom solution)
2. **Create the flag** in your feature management dashboard
3. **Add the DarkModeToggle component** to your admin dashboard
4. **Wrap it with feature flag check** as shown above
5. **Test both states** - with flag enabled and disabled

This implementation gives you full control over when the dark mode toggle appears to users, allowing you to roll it out gradually or turn it off if needed.

